    CanvasView -->|holds the copied Fragment, so it survives Level changes| Level
    Level -->|classifies key events| clipboardShortcut
    Level -->|"paste: centres the Fragment on the cursor"| pasteOffset
    Level -->|"Cmd/Ctrl+C, V, D: copy, paste, duplicate (copy then paste, skipping the copied Fragment)"| Workspace
    CanvasView -->|"nodeTypes 'placement' (module-level), the only node type"| PlacementNode
    CanvasView -->|"click on empty pane (not one that deselects) or right-click: pick a kind, component included"| ResourcePicker
    ResourcePicker -->|addPlacement| Diagram
    ResourcePicker -->|"createPlacedResource; lists resources.byKind without cyclic ones (wouldCreateCycle)"| Workspace
    ResourcePicker --> resourceIcons
    PlacementNode --> resourceIcons
    PlacementNode -->|"non-component Handles: read, write or top, right, bottom, left"| ResourceKinds
