    PlacementNode -->|"component: open button"| Navigator
    RenameController -.implements.-> ObservableStore
    RenameController --> Scheduler
    DeleteFlow -->|resourceImpact, removeResource| Workspace
    CanvasView -->|request| DeleteFlow
    Inspector -->|request: placement or resource| DeleteFlow
    TypesDialog -->|add, rename, remove types| Workspace
    TypesDialog -->|remove refused| Notifier
    ExceptionsDialog -->|"add, rename, exceptionUsage, removeException (after confirmation)"| Workspace
    Inspector -->|setExceptions| ComponentDefinition
    EnvironmentVariablesDialog -->|"add, rename, environmentVariableUsage, removeEnvironmentVariable (after confirmation)"| Workspace
    Inspector -->|setEnvironmentVariables| ComponentDefinition
    View -->|useStore| Domain
    View -->|commands| Domain
